{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"2015018010020","name":"甜花","text":"ソロ曲って……\r\n甜花の、歌……？","trans":"个人曲……\n是甜花的歌……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"甜花のこれまでの『頑張り』が\r\n繋がりそうだな","trans":"甜花至今为止的『努力』\n好像能连成一片呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010040","name":"甜花","text":"ソロ曲は……","trans":"个人曲是……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010050","name":"甜花","text":"頑張った、ご褒美……？","trans":"努力的，奖励……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"ご褒美……というよりは……\r\nランクアップのための特別クエスト、かな……？","trans":"奖励……不如说是……\n为了升级的特别任务，吧……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-11","name":"プロデューサー","text":"お、やる気になったか","trans":"哦，有干劲了嘛","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010070","name":"甜花","text":"うん……\r\n甜花、やってみる……！","trans":"嗯……\n甜花，试试看……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010090","name":"甜花","text":"（ソロ曲……）","trans":"（个人曲……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010100","name":"甜花","text":"（どんな、だろ……）","trans":"（会是怎样的呢……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010110","name":"甜花","text":"（甜花の歌……）","trans":"（甜花的歌……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010120","name":"甜花","text":"（ひとりで、歌うんだよね……）","trans":"（要一个人，唱呢……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010140","name":"甜花","text":"（……どんな、だろ……）","trans":"（……会是怎样的呢……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010160","name":"甜花","text":"（こんな……？）","trans":"（这样的……？）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010170","name":"甜花","text":"（……調べて、みよ……！）","trans":"（……查查看，吧……！）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010180","name":"甜花","text":"……あ、これ……\r\nソロ曲って、書いてある……","trans":"……啊，这个……\n写着个人曲……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010190","name":"甜花","text":"…………\r\nこんな、感じ……？","trans":"…………\n这种，感觉……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010200","name":"甜花","text":"……こっちも、ソロ曲……\r\nインタビュー……？","trans":"……这边也是，个人曲……\n采访……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010210","name":"甜花","text":"なるほど……\r\n……おお、なるほどなるほど……","trans":"原来如此……\n……哦哦，原来如此原来如此……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010220","name":"甜花","text":"なんか……\r\n……いける、かも……！","trans":"怎么说呢……\n……好像，能行……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010230","name":"甜花","text":"……あ、もう……\r\nこんな時間……","trans":"……啊，已经……\n这个时间了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010240","name":"甜花","text":"寝なきゃ……","trans":"得睡了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010260","name":"甜花","text":"（寝て、起きる……）","trans":"（睡觉，起床……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010270","name":"甜花","text":"（早起きして、ちょっと……\r\nんー、とか、して……）","trans":"（早点起来，稍微……\n嗯——，哼一哼，之类的……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010280","name":"甜花","text":"（ソロ曲、もらったら……\r\nちゃんと歌ってみて、大丈夫かとか……）","trans":"（拿到个人曲之后……\n好好唱唱看，确认没问题之类的……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010290","name":"甜花","text":"（歌詞も、ちゃんと読んで……）","trans":"（歌词也要，好好读一遍……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010300","name":"甜花","text":"（……甜花の歌に、してく……）","trans":"（……把它变成甜花的歌……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"2015018010320","name":"甜花","text":"……自分、の……\r\n歌……","trans":"……自己的……\n歌……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}